  "problem": "If \n$Q=[\\begin{aligned}a & b & a \\\\ a & -b & a \\\\ 0 & 0 & a\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$r=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 0 \\\\ -a\\end{aligned}],$\nfind $Qr.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Qr=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |",
